      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILD MOOD (2) collided with another runner and finished a well held 5 lengths fifth (16.42) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track over 275m. Tough to beat on best and worth another try. EVANDER KEEPING (7) turned in a plain effort last time when eighth at this track over 275m behind Stubborn Mouse (16.80) in a Grade 5/6. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Cannot be taken lightly. CAKE IN TUMMY (3) pinged the lids from a wide box and crossed to the lead, sticking on for second (16.38) at this track in a Grade 6 over 275m. Bold showing expected. GETAWAY STICKS (1) can measure up with the right run.",
